    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Owen Reilly presents this well-located one-bedroom ground-floor apartment with views towards Grand Canal Dock, ideally situated within this popular and well-maintained waterside development. The property offers comfortable accommodation in a convenient and sought-after location. The interior briefly comprises an entrance hallway, spacious open-plan  kitchen/living/dining room, one double bedroom and a bathroom. The apartment is ideally positioned within easy reach of a host of amenities, restaurants and transport links.\r\n\r\nMore about the location...\r\n\r\nVibrant setting on the doorstep of the city centre just minutes from Grand Canal Dock offering an abundance of amenities including cafés, restaurants, shopping, theatres and much more. The area is well served by local bus routes and Grand Canal Dock DART station is a five minute walk away. Some of Dublin's finest entertainment attractions are all within walking distance including The Bord Gais Energy Theatre, the Aviva Stadium and the Convention Centre Dublin. The property is within walking distance of a large number of prestigious employers such as AirBnB, Google, Mason Hayes Curran, William Fry, Facebook and many more."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Attractive one-bedroom apartment.\r\nAvailable immediately.\r\nPrime Dublin 4 location.\r\nStunning views over Grand Canal Dock.\r\nOpen-plan living dining area.\r\nExcellent transport links nearby.\r\nWell managed development.\r\nOne parking permit available.\r\nHost of amenities on the doorstep.\r\nCommunal rooftop garden.\r\nOn-site caretaker."
      }
    ],
